@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Data and Trends" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Aligned with Profile" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts for Budget Control" as CFR006
  usecase "CFR007: Access Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "CFR008: Receive News Related to Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "CFR009: Consolidated Personalized Dashboard for Finances" as CFR009
  usecase "CFR010: Manage Relationship with Financial Advisors" as CFR010

  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001

  usecase "FAFR001: Manage Client Mentoring Sessions Based on Insights" as FAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Intervention Alerts for Clients" as FAFR002
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics About Clients' Situations" as FAFR003

  usecase "SFR001: Deliver Alerts Through Notification Channels" as SFR001
  usecase "SFR002: Provide Personalized Recommendations Based on Profiles" as SFR002
  usecase "SFR003: Request Financial Predictions from AI Component" as SFR003
  usecase "SFR004: Request Personalized Recommendations From AI Component" as SFR004
  usecase "SFR005: Request Spending Limit Alerts From AI Component" as SFR005
  usecase "SFR006: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis from AI Component" as SFR006

  usecase "AIFR001: Generate Financial Predictions Based on Data and Trends" as AIFR001
  usecase "AIFR002: Generate Personalized Recommendations for Users" as AIFR002
  usecase "AIFR003: Identify Spending Limit Alerts Through Pattern Recognition" as AIFR003

  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to Improve System Outputs" as CFR011
}

actor Client as C
actor SysAdmin as SA
actor FinancialAdvisor as FA
actor User as U

Client --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard.
Client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts on anomalous transactions.
Client --> CFR003 : View financial predictions based on data and trends.
Client --> CFR004 : Personalized recommendations aligned with profile.
Client --> CFR005 : Manage recommendation preferences.
Client --> CFR006 : View spending limit alerts for budget control.
Client --> CFR007 : Access investment opportunities based on risk profile.
Client --> CFR008 : Receive news related to portfolio.
Client --> CFR009 : Consolidated personalized dashboard for finances.
Client --> CFR010 : Manage relationship with financial advisors.

SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters.

FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR001 : Manage client mentoring sessions based on insights.
FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002 : View intervention alerts when system detects patterns requiring attention.
FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003 : View predictive analytics about clients' financial situations for consultations.

User --> SFR001 : Deliver alerts through channels (for all users).
Client, FinancialAdvisor, SysAdmin --> SFR002 : Personalized recommendations based on profiles.
Client, SysAdmin --> SFR003 : Request financial predictions from AI component.
Client, SysAdmin --> SFR004 : Request personalized recommendations from AI component.
Client, SysAdmin --> SFR005 : Request spending limit alerts from AI component.
Client, SysAdmin --> SFR006 : Request investment opportunity analysis from AI component.

AIFR001 <|-- AIFR002 : Generate personalized recommendations.
AIFR003 <|-- AIFR004 : Identify spending limit alerts (pattern recognition).
AIFR005 <|-- AIFR006 : Find investment opportunities based on risk profile and strategies.

Client --> CFR011 : Send feedback to system for improvement.

@enduml